<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ZEC" style="id">Kwele Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Zekalia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zekalia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zekalia</para>
  <para style="toc3">Zek</para>
  <para style="mt">Zekalia</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu chino china ulotezi wa Zekalia. Zekalia kakala kolotela muna ulusita luja luja lwa Hagai. Luno lukala lusita luja Waisilaili viwabwelile kulawa kuutumwa uko Babeli. Fana viyatendile Hagai, iviya Zekalia kawaguma moyo Waisilaili kukomeleza kuizenga kaidi kaye ya Mndewa Mulungu (sula ya 8:9). Zekalia kalawa muna uwelesi wa wakulu wa nhambiko, ivo wasaho yake Iddo kapetigwa muna iwakulu wa nhambiko wabwelile kulawa Babeli (Nehemia 12:4). Ulotezi wa Zekalia ulavigwa muna umwaka 520-480 KK.</para>
  <para style="ip">Zekalia kawalongela Waisilaili wambwelele Mulungu muladi Mulungu iviya yawabwelele wawo (sula ya 1:3). Ulotezi wa Zekalia wolumbagiza malaguso manane yalawilile ichilo chimwe. Yosonhela vinhu viya vimalile kutendeka. Maabaho Zekalia kalotela miyanza midi kusonhela faida za hamwande za Isilaili. Muna uulotezi uno muna mbuli ya munhu yokwiza yasaguligwe na Mulungu kwa sang'hano zelile (sula ya 9:9).</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zilimuno</para>
  <para style="io">1. Sula ya 1:1-6 Yomtambula Zekalia na usenga wake.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Sula ya 1:7 mbaka sula ya 6:8 zina malaguso manane yaja Zekalia yoyawone ichilo chimwe.</para>
  <para style="io">3. Sula ya 6:9 mbaka sula ya 8:23 zolonga Yoshua viyakalile mkulu wa nhambiko digogogo na kufunga kuja muna iisi ya Isilaili.</para>
  <para style="io">4. Sula ya 9 mbaka sula ya 14 zina malaguso maidi kusonhela munhu yasaguligwe na Mulungu kwa sang'hano yelile hamwe na ufalume wa Mulungu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ZEC 1" />
  <para style="s">Waisilaili wolongeligwa wasame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:1" />Muna umwezi wenane, mwaka wekaidi wa utawala wa mfalume Dalio, mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu imwizila mulotezi Zekalia mwana wa Belekia, mzukulu wa Ido. Ilonga, <verse eid="ZEC 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:2" />“Mndewa Mulungu kawawonela ludoko ng'hani wasaho zenu. <verse eid="ZEC 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:3" />Ivo uwalongele wanhu kuwa Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga, one muhanibwelela, nizambwelelani. <verse eid="ZEC 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:4" />Sekemuwe fana wasaho zenu, waja walotezi walongole wawalongela Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga, ‘Hindukeni muzileke nzila zenu zihile na sang'hano zenu zihile.’ Mbali hawanitegeleze na hawazindilile chiya chinilongile. <verse eid="ZEC 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:5" />Vino wasaho zenu wakulihi? Vino walotezi wezakuwa wagima siku zose? <verse eid="ZEC 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:6" />Mbuli zangu na ndagilizi zangu zoniwalagilize wasang'hani wangu walotezi, zifikizigwa kwa wasaho zenu. Maabaho waleka uhasanyi wawo na walonga, ‘Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kachitenda viya voilondeka kwa ichimu cha uhasanyi wetu na sang'hano zetu fana viyailungile kutenda.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaguso ya Zekalia kusonhela mkwelafalasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:7" />Muna isiku ya malongo maidi na nne ya mwezi wa longo na umwe, niuwo mwezi utangigwe Shebati, mwaka wekaidi wa utawala wa Dalio, mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu imwizila mulotezi Zekalia mwana wa Belekia, mzukulu wa Ido. Ilonga ivo. <verse eid="ZEC 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:8" />Ichilo niwona munhu kakwela falasi mdung'hu. Munhu iyo kakala kema hagati ya mibiki itangigwa mihadasi ikalile kuna dibawe. Kuchisogo chake kukala na falasi wamwenga wadung'hu na wa langi ya ivu na wazelu. <verse eid="ZEC 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:9" />Maabaho nimuuza msenga iyo, “Mwenevale, falasi wano wana fambulo jaki?” Msenga iyo wa Mndewa Mulungu yalongile na niye kanilongela, “Nizakulagusila waja falasi wana fambulo jaki.” <verse eid="ZEC 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:10" />Maabaho munhu iyo yemile hagati ya mibiki itangigwa mihadasi kalonga, “Wawo watumigwa na Mndewa Mulungu wahite kuna izisi zose.” <verse eid="ZEC 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:11" />Wawo wamulongela msenga iyo wa Mndewa Mulungu yemile hagati ya mibiki itangigwa mihadasi, “Chilolesa zisi zose, kweli zikala na tindiwalo.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:12" />Maabaho msenga wa Mndewa Mulungu kalonga, “Weye Mndewa Mulungu Uli na Udahi, mbaka zuwaki kwizalema kuwawonela ubazi wanhu wa Yelusalemu na mabululu yano ya Yuda youyawonele ludoko kwa miyaka malongo saba?” <verse eid="ZEC 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:13" />Ivo Mndewa Mulungu kamwidika msenga yalongile na niye kwa mbuli zinogile na kwa mbuli za kuguma moyo. <verse eid="ZEC 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:14" />Maabaho msenga iyo yalongile na niye kanilongela, “Gong'onda kuwa Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga, ‘Nina wivu ng'hani kwa ichimu cha Yelusalemu na Sayuni. <verse eid="ZEC 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:15" />Niye nizaziwonela ludoko ng'hani zisi zimwenga zili na tindiwalo. Niwawonela ludoko chidogo Waisilaili, mbali wanhu wa zisi zimwenga waiyoha kuwananga.’ ” <verse eid="ZEC 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:16" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga, “Nodibwelela bululu da Yelusalemu kwa ubazi na kaye yangu izazengigwa umo. Wezakwandusa kudizenga kaidi bululu da Yelusalemu.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:17" />Maabaho msenga iyo kanilongela, “Guta na ulonge, ‘Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga, “Mabululu yangu yezamema mbuli zinogile muhala. Niye Mndewa Mulungu nizawagangamiza kaidi wanhu wa Sayuni, iviya nizasagula bululu da Yelusalemu kuwa bululu jangu.” ’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaguso ya Zekalia kusonhela mhembe na wahunzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:18" />Maabaho nilola, niwona mhembe nne.<verse eid="ZEC 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:19" />Nimuuza msenga ija yalongile na niye, “Chino choni?” Nayo kanidika, “Zino niizo mhembe zowazipwililise wanhu wa Yuda na Isilaili na Yelusalemu.” <verse eid="ZEC 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:20" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kanilagusila wahunzi wane. <verse eid="ZEC 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:21" />Niuza, “Wano wokwiza kutenda choni?” Iyo kanidika, “Zino niizo mhembe zowazipwililise muladi munhu yoyose sekeyenule ditwi jake. Mbali wahunzi weza kuwadumbiza wanhu na wazasa hasi zimhembe zino za zisi zimwenga zozinule mhembe zawo kwa ichimu cha kuwapwililisa wanhu wa Yuda.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ZEC 2" />
  <para style="s">Malaguso ya Zekalia kusonhela munhu yeli na luzabi lwa kulingila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:1" />Maabaho muna yamalaguso yangu, kuulongozi wangu k ukala na munhu yamhile luzabi lwa kulingila.<verse eid="ZEC 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:2" />Nimuuza, “Weye kohita kulihi?” Kanidika, “Nohita kudilinga bululu da Yelusalemu utali na ugalamu.”<verse eid="ZEC 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:3" />Msenga ija yakalile yolonga na niye kasegela, maabaho msenga imwenga keza kuiting'hana nayo.<verse eid="ZEC 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:4" />Lelo msenga iyo yakalile yolonga na niye kamulongela miyage, “Kimbila ukamulongele mbwanga ija kuwa Yelusalemu dizakuwa bululu dilibule ng'huta, kwaviya umo wanhu wezakuwa wengi na mifugo izakuwa mingi. <verse eid="ZEC 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:5" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga kuwa yeye mwenyewo kezakuwa ng'huta ya moto kudikaliza bululu ijo banzi zose. Kwaviya kezakala umo, bululu ijo dizakuwa na ukulu mgati yake.”<verse eid="ZEC 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu weli kuuhami wotangigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:6" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Izoni! Izoni! Kimbileni mulawe muna iisi ya kasikazi. Kwaviya nimgolani chila ubanzi fana beho vodihita kuna zibanzi nne za isi. <verse eid="ZEC 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:7" />Izoni mweye mukala isi ya Babeli, mukimbilile Sayuni.” <verse eid="ZEC 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:8" />Viyamalile kunituma kwa ukulu kuhita kuna izisi zimtekileni mweye, Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kalonga, “Munhu yoyose yomdalisani mweye, kodalisa mwana wa ziso jangu. <verse eid="ZEC 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:9" />Kweli nizawinula mkono wangu kuwatagusa na watumwa wawo wezawateka. Baho mwizavimanya kuwa Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi niiyo yanitumile.”<verse eid="ZEC 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:10" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Guteni nyangi na mudeng'helele mweye wanhu wa Sayuni, kwaviya nokwiza na nizakala hamwe na mweye. <verse eid="ZEC 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:11" />Zisi nyingi zizailumba na Mndewa Mulungu siku iyo, nawo wezakuwa wanhu wangu. Niye nizakala hamwe na mweye.” Baho mwizavimanya kuwa Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kanituma kumwenu. <verse eid="ZEC 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:12" />Mndewa Mulungu kezaihazi isi ya Yuda, muladi iwe hanhu hake muna iisi yelile. Nayo kezadisagula kaidi bululu da Yelusalemu kuwa jake. <verse eid="ZEC 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:13" />Nyamaleni mweye wanhu wose mwili haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu, kwaviya kokwiza kulawa muna ikaye yake yelile.<verse eid="ZEC 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ZEC 3" />
  <para style="s">Malaguso ya Zekalia kusonhela mkulu wa nhambiko digogogo Yoshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:1" />Maabaho msenga wa Mndewa Mulungu kanilagusila mkulu wa nhambiko digogogo Yoshua kema haulongozi ha msenga wa Mndewa Mulungu. Nayo Shetani kema ubanzi wake wa kulume muladi yamulongeleze. <verse eid="ZEC 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:2" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Shetani, “Niye nokuzuma weye Shetani. Niye niisagule Yelusalemu nokuzuma. Vino munhu iyo halingile fana lugodi lulavigwe muna umoto?”<verse eid="ZEC 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:3" />Yoshua viyemile haulongozi wa msenga wa Mndewa Mulungu, kakala kaiyawala mawalo yafilile ng'hani.<verse eid="ZEC 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:4" />Msenga iyo kawalongela waja wakalile wema haulongozi wake, “Mvuleni mawalo yake yafilile ng'hani.” Maabaho kamulongela mkulu wa nhambiko digogogo Yoshua, “Niusegeza uhasanyi wako na nizakuyawaza mawalo ya bei ng'hulu.” <verse eid="ZEC 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:5" />Maabaho kawalongela, “Mvazeni chilemba chinogile mditwi jake.” Baho wamvaza chilemba chinogile mditwi jake na wamuyawaza mawalo yamwenga kuno msenga iyo kema habehi. <verse eid="ZEC 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:6" />Maabaho msenga wa Mndewa Mulungu kamzuma mkulu wa nhambiko digogogo Yoshua, kamulagiliza, <verse eid="ZEC 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:7" />“Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga, ‘One uhatenda vonilonda na kuzindilila malagilizo yangu, kwizalola goya kaye yangu na luwa lwangu. Niye nizakulekelela wime haulongozi wangu fana wano wemile hano. <verse eid="ZEC 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:8" />Tegeleza weye mkulu wa nhambiko digogogo Yoshua hamwe na wayago weli haulongozi wako. Wawo chilaguso cha mbuli zikwiza. Nohita kumgala msang'hani wangu yotangigwa Tawi. <verse eid="ZEC 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:9" />Lola nika haulongozi wa Yoshua dibwe dili na vihanga saba. Nizachola maandiko muna idibwe na siku dimwe muhala nizausegeza uhasanyi wa isi ino. Kweli niye Mndewa Mulungu Nili na Udahi nilonga ivo. <verse eid="ZEC 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:10" />Siku iyo chila munhu kezamgoneka mkaya miyage kudeng'helela tindiwalo na unhu goya muna ichizi chake cha mizabibu na hasi ya minhini yake. Niye Mndewa Mulungu Nili na Udahi nilonga ivo.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 3:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ZEC 4" />
  <para style="s">Malaguso ya Zekalia kusonhela chinala cha chitasa na mibiki ya mizaituni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:1" />Msenga wa Mndewa wa Mulungu yalongile na niye kanizila kaidi kunilamusa fana munhu viyolamusigwa muna zinhongo. <verse eid="ZEC 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:2" />Kaniuza, “Kowona choni?” Niye nimwidika, “Nowona chinala cha chitasa cha zahabu, uchanyha yake china hamha na vitasa vake saba uchanyha yake, iviya kuna milija saba ya kugala mavuta kuna ivitasa vose vili uchanyha yake. <verse eid="ZEC 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:3" />Habehi ya chinala hakala na mizaituni midi, umwe ubanzi wa kulume na umwenga ubanzi wa kumoso.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:4" />Maabaho nimuuza msenga ija, “Mwenevale, vinhu vino fambulo jake choni?” <verse eid="ZEC 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:5" />Nayo kanidika, “Weye huvimanyile bule fambulo da vinhu vino?” Nimwidika, “Kweli, sivimanyile bule, mwenevale wangu.” <verse eid="ZEC 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:6" />Msenga ija kanilongela, “Ino niiyo mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu kwa Zelubabeli, yolonga, ‘Siyo kwa udahi hebu nguvu, mbali kwa Muhe wangu,’ Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga ivo.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:7" />Maabaho kagendelela kulonga, “Vino mulima wokukimilila? Bule! Weye Zelubabeli kwizausesa. Kwizaizenga kaidi kaye ya Mulungu, lusita vondawike dibwe da kukomelezela, wanhu wezadeng'helela kuno wolonga, ‘Mulungu itemele mate, Mulungu itemele mate.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:8" />Maabaho mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu inizila kaidi, ilonga, <verse eid="ZEC 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:9" />“Zelubabeli kazenga chandusilo cha kaye ino ya Mulungu, iviya kezaikomeleza. Baho mwizavimanya kuwa Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kanituma kumwenu. <verse eid="ZEC 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:10" />Vino yelihi yoyehula siku ya mbuli ndodo? Wanhu wezadeng'helela vondawawone Zelubabeli kamha timazi. Vitasa vino saba ni meso ya Mndewa Mulungu, yolola zisi zose.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:11" />Maabaho nimuuza msenga iyo, “Mizaituni ino midi ili ubanzi wa kulume na kumoso wa chinala ina fambulo jaki?” <verse eid="ZEC 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:12" />Iviya nimuuza, “Matambi yano maidi ya mizaituni yeli habehi na milija iyo midi ya zahabu yoigida mavuta ina fambulo jaki?”<verse eid="ZEC 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:13" />Nayo kanidika, “Vino huvimanyile chino choni?” Nimwidika, “Sivimanyile, mwenevale wangu.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:14" />Maabaho kanilongela, “Wano niwawo waidi wahakigwe mavuta muladi kumsang'hanila Mndewa Mulungu wa zisi zose.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ZEC 5" />
  <para style="s">Malaguso ya Zekalia kusonhela chitabu chiguluka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:1" />Nilola kaidi kuulanga na niwona chitabu choguluka uko. <verse eid="ZEC 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:2" />Msenga iyo kaniuza, “Kowona choni?” Nimwidika, “Nowona chitabu choguluka, utali wake mita kenda na ugalamu wake mita nne na nusu.” <verse eid="ZEC 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:3" />Maabaho kanilongela, “Mgati ya chitabu icho mwandikigwa kuduwiligwa kondakuwapate wanhu wa isi yose. Ubanzi umwe wandikigwa kuwa wabavi wose wezawingigwa muna iisi na ubanzi umwenga wandikigwa kuwa wanhu wose woilaha uvwizi wezatendigwa ivo. <verse eid="ZEC 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:4" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga, ‘Nizagala kuduwiligwa, nako kwizakwingila muna ikaye ya mbavi na muna ikaye ya munhu yoilaha uvwizi kwa zina jangu. Kwizasigala muna ikaye yake na kwiinanga, mbaka mibiki yake na mabwe yake.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaguso ya Zekalia kusonhela muke yeli muna ichigelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:5" />Maabaho msenga iyo wa Mndewa Mulungu yakalile kanizila kanilongela, “Lola uchanyha uwone chinhu chilawilila.” <verse eid="ZEC 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:6" />Nimuuza, “Icho choni?” Nayo kanidika, “Icho chigelo cha kulingila chili na uhasanyi wa wanhu wa isi yose.” <verse eid="ZEC 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:7" />Chigelo chenyewo chikala na ngubiko ya chuma. Vichigubuligwe, niwona mwanamke kakala umo. <verse eid="ZEC 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:8" />Kanilongela, “Ino Wihi,” Maabaho msenga ija kamsung'hila mwanamke iyo muna ichigelo na kachigubika na chuma kaidi. <verse eid="ZEC 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:9" />Maabaho niwawona wanaake waidi wolawilila, wakala wosung'higwa na vulavumbi, iviya wakala na mabawa yeli na nguvu fana ya hondohondo. Wanaake wawo wakala wokwinula chigelo chiya muna yamawingu. <verse eid="ZEC 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:10" />Maabaho nimuuza ija msenga wa Mulungu yalongile na niye, “Chigelo icho wochigala kulihi?” <verse eid="ZEC 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:11" />Nayo kanidika, “Wochigala kuna iisi ya Babeli. Uko wezazenga kaye ya kwikila chigelo. Vondaimale, wezachika umo.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ZEC 6" />
  <para style="s">Malaguso ya Zekalia kusonhela matololi mane ya kubululigwa na falasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:1" />Niwona malaguso yamwenga. Niwona matololi mane ya kubululigwa na falasi yolawa hagati ya milima midi ya shaba. <verse eid="ZEC 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:2" />Tololi da mwanduso dibululigwa na falasi wadung'hu, tololi dekaidi dibululigwa na falasi watitu. <verse eid="ZEC 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:3" />Tololi deketatu dibululigwa na falasi wazelu, tololi dekane dibululigwa na falasi weli na mawolawola wa langi ya ivu. <verse eid="ZEC 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:4" />Maabaho nimuuza msenga ija yalongile na niye, “Mwenevale, matololi yano ya kubululigwa na falasi yana fambulo jaki?” <verse eid="ZEC 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:5" />Msenga ija kanidika, “Matololi yano ni beho kulawa banzi nne za isi. Yakala kuulongozi wa Mndewa yotawala zisi zose, lelo yosegela. <verse eid="ZEC 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:6" />Tololi diya da kubululigwa na falasi watitu dohita ubanzi wa kasikazi, tololi diya dibululigwa na falasi wazelu dohohita ubanzi wa uswelo wa zuwa, tololi diya dibululigwa na falasi wa langi ya ivu dohita ubanzi wa kusi. <verse eid="ZEC 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:7" />Falasi wawo viwalawilile wakala na hamu ya kulola zisi zose.” Msenga iyo kawalongela, “Hiteni mukalole zisi zose.” Ivo wahita kuna izisi zose. <verse eid="ZEC 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:8" />Maabaho msenga iyo yalongile na niye kalandula dizi, kanilongela, “Falasi waja wahitile ubanzi wa kasikazi wahoza muhe wangu muna iisi ili ubanzi wa kasikazi.”<verse eid="ZEC 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoshua kovazigwa kombelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:9" />Mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu inizila, ilonga, <verse eid="ZEC 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:10" />“Hokela vitumetume vilawa kwa Helidai na Tobia na Yedaya weli kuuhami uko Babeli. Siku iyo iyo uhite kuna ikaye ya Yosia mwana wa Sefania. <verse eid="ZEC 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:11" />Sola hela na zahabu iyo, utende kombelo na umvaze mkulu wa nhambiko digogogo Yoshua mwana wa Yehosadaki, <verse eid="ZEC 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:12" />na umulongele kuwa Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga, ‘Hano hana munhu kotangigwa Tambi, iyo kezasuka hanhu hake na kuizenga kaye ya Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="ZEC 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:13" />Iyo niiyo yondayazenge kaye ya Mndewa Mulungu. Kezakwing'higwa hishima ya chifalume na kezakala kuna ichigoda chake cha chifalume. Iviya kwizakuwa na mkulu wa nhambiko yondayakale nayo muna ichigoda cha chifalume, nawo waidi wezatenda usang'hano hamwe kwa tindiwalo.’ <verse eid="ZEC 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:14" />Kombelo ijo dizakalizwa muna ikaye ya Mndewa Mulungu muladi kuwakumbuka Helidai na Tobia na Yedaya na Heni mwana wa Sefania. <verse eid="ZEC 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:15" />Wanhu wokala kuna izisi zili kutali wezakwiza kutaza kuizenga kaye ya Mndewa Mulungu. Baho mwizavimanya kuwa Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi niiyo yanitumile kumwenu. Mbuli izo zizalawilila one muhazindilila mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu.”<verse eid="ZEC 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ZEC 7" />
  <para style="s">Ubazi na kuhumiza voilondeka vofaya kufosa kufunga kuja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:1" />Muna isiku yekane ya mwezi wa kenda utangigwa Kisileu na mwaka wa nne wa utawala wa mfalume Dalio, mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu imwizila Zekalia.<verse eid="ZEC 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:2" />Wanhu wa bululu da Beseli wakala wawatuma Shaleza na Legemu Meleki hamwe na wanhu wawo muladi wampule Mndewa Mulungu yawatemele mate, <verse eid="ZEC 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:3" />na wawauze walotezi na wakulu wa nhambiko wa kaye ya Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi, “Vino chigendelele kulila kwa giyogiyo na kufunga kuja muna umwezi wetano fana vichitendile kwa miyaka mingi?”<verse eid="ZEC 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:4" />Maabaho mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi inizila, ilonga, <verse eid="ZEC 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:5" />“Uwalongele wanhu wose wokala muna iisi na wakulu wa nhambiko, ‘Miyaka malongo saba ifosile mukala mufunga kuja na mulila kwa giyogiyo muna umwezi wetano na mwezi wesaba. Vino mugesa mufunga kuja kwa ichimu changu? <verse eid="ZEC 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:6" />Vimuja na kung'wa, vino hamuja na kung'wa kwa ichimu chenu wenyewo? <verse eid="ZEC 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:7" />Mbuli zino niizo ziyalongile Mndewa Mulungu kwa milomo ya walotezi wa umwaka, lusita ulo bululu da Yelusalemu na vibululu vake vikala na wanhu wengi, iviya isi ya Negebu na isi ya mabawe zikala na wanhu wengi.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:8" />Mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu imwizila Zekalia, ilonga, <verse eid="ZEC 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:9" />“Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga, ‘Muhumize voilondeka, chila munhu yamuwonele ubazi ndugu yake na yamtendele mbuli zinogile. <verse eid="ZEC 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:10" />Sekemuwagaze wakefilwa hebu wachiwa hebu nyambenyambe hebu ngayengaye. Iviya sekemuilunge kuwatendela mbuli zihile wanhu wamwenga.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:11" />Mbali wawo walema kutegeleza na wabena mayega yawo na wasita magutwi yawo muladi sekewahulike. <verse eid="ZEC 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:12" />Waitenda imizoyo yawo kuwa midala fana dibwe muladi sekewahulike malagilizo ya Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi yoyagong'onde kwa muhe wake kufosela walotezi walongole. Ivo Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kawawonela ludoko ng'hani. <verse eid="ZEC 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:13" />Iviya nihulika mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi ilonga, “Kwaviya viniwatangile hawanihulike, ivo nawo viwanitangile siwahulike. <verse eid="ZEC 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:14" />Mbali niwamwaga kwa beho kulu muna izisi zose hawazimanyile. Ivo isi iwailekile isigala matongo, habule munhu yakalile umo. Isi iyo inogile isigala matongo.”<verse eid="ZEC 7:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ZEC 8" />
  <para style="s">Bululu da Yelusalemu dizakuwa bululu da tindiwalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:1" />Mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi inizila, ilonga, <verse eid="ZEC 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:2" />“Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga, ‘Nina wivu ng'hani kwa ichimu cha Sayuni, ivo nowehila ng'hani wehi wake. <verse eid="ZEC 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:3" />Nizaubweleza mulima wa Sayuni na kwika kaye yangu muna dibululu da Yelusalemu. Bululu da Yelusalemu dizatangigwa, “Bululu dikwaminika.” Iviya mulima wa Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi wizatangigwa mulima welile.’ ” <verse eid="ZEC 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:4" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga, “Walala wa chilume na wa chike wezawoneka kaidi wokala hasi muna yamakulugumbi ya Yelusalemu kuno chila munhu kana mhome yake kwaviya walala ng'hani. <verse eid="ZEC 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:5" />Makulugumbi ya Yelusalemu yezamema wandele na wabwanga wokwangala umo.” <verse eid="ZEC 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:6" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga, “Mbuli zino zodaha kuwoneka za mwazanyo kwa wanhu wasigale siku iyo. Mbali hazizadaha kuwoneka za mwazanyo kumwangu.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:7" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga, “Nizawakombola wanhu wangu kulawa isi ili ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa na kulawa isi ili ubanzi wa uswelo wa zuwa. <verse eid="ZEC 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:8" />Nizawagala Yelusalemu na wezakala umo. Wezakuwa wanhu wangu na niye nizakuwa Mulungu wawo. Nizakuwa mwaminika kumwawo na nizahumiza voilondeka.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:9" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga, “Mweye womuhulika sambi mbuli zino zozilongigwa na walotezi wowakalile siku izo za kwika vandusilo va kaye ya Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi, muigangamize muladi kaye ya Mndewa Mulungu izengigwe. <verse eid="ZEC 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:10" />Kwaviya ing'hali siku izo hazinafika, hakukalile na fungu da munhu hebu da mnyama. Iviya hakuwile na tindiwalo kwa munhu yalawile hebu kwa munhu yengile kwaviya wehi wakala chila hanhu. Niye nimuleka chila munhu yagombe na miyage. <verse eid="ZEC 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:11" />Mbali sambi sizawatagusa wanhu wosigala fana voniwataguse umwaka.” Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga ivo. <verse eid="ZEC 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:12" />“Nizagala tindiwalo muna iisi, muladi wahande mbeyu. Mzabibu wizakwima matunda yake na isi izalawa mazao yake na mvula izatonya voilondeka. Vinhu ivo vose nizaweng'ha wanhu wasigale muna iisi ino viwe vawo. <verse eid="ZEC 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:13" />Mweye wanhu wa Yuda na wanhu wa Isilaili, lusita lufosile muwoneka fana viya wanhu womuduwiligwe muna iwanhu wa zisi zimwenga. Mbali sambi nizamkombolani na mwizawatemela mate wamwenga. Ivo sekemudumbe kaidi mbali muwe magalu.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:14" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga, “Niilunga kumtendelani mbuli zihile kwaviya wasaho zenu waniguma ludoko na siwawonele ubazi, <verse eid="ZEC 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:15" />mbali sambi noilunga kuditendela mbuli zinogile bululu da Yelusalemu na wanhu wa kaye ya Yuda. Ivo sekemudumbe. <verse eid="ZEC 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:16" />Molondeka mutende vino. Chila munhu yalonge ukweli na mkaya miyage. Siku zose vitala venu vihumize voilondeka na vigale tindiwalo. <verse eid="ZEC 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:17" />Munhu yoyose sekeyailunge kumtendela miyage mbuli zihile na sekemuilahe kwa uvwizi, kwaviya nozihila ng'hani mbuli izo. Niye Mndewa Mulungu nolonga ivo.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:18" />Mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi inizila, ilonga, <verse eid="ZEC 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:19" />“Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga, ‘Siku za kufunga kuja kwa mwezi wekane na mwezi wetano na mwezi wesaba na mwezi welongo, izo zizakuwa siku za ng'henze na kudeng'helela na madugila ya kusangalala kwa wanhu wa Yuda. Ivo mulonde kulonga ukweli na muwe na tindiwalo.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:20" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga, “Wanhu wengi wa zisi zimwenga na wakaya wa mabululu mengi wezakwiza. <verse eid="ZEC 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:21" />Wakaya wa bululu dimwe wezawahitila wakaya wa bululu dimwenga, wezalonga, ‘Chihite himahima chikamtambikile Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi na chikampule yachitemele mate.’ <verse eid="ZEC 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:22" />Kweli, zisi zili na nguvu na wanhu wengi wezakwiza Yelusalemu kumtambikila Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi na kumpula yawatemele mate.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:23" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga, “Siku izo wanhu longo kulawa chila kabila na chila ulonzi wezakwamhisa mhindo za walo da Muyahudi, kweli wezamwamha na kulonga, ‘Chihite hamwe na weye, kwaviya chihulika kuwa Mulungu kahamwe na weye.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 8:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ZEC 9" />
  <para style="s">Wehi wa Waisilaili wotagusigwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:1" />Mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu ilongigwe kusonhela isi ya Hadulaki na bululu da Damasiki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:1">Baho hezakuwa hanhu hake ha kukala goya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:1">Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kowalola wanhu wose na makabila yose ya Isilaili.<verse eid="ZEC 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:2" />Iviya kowalola wanhu wa bululu da Hamasi dodihakana na Hadulaki</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:2">na mbaka mabululu ya Tilo na Sidoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:2">ingawa wakala wabala ng'hani.<verse eid="ZEC 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:3" />Wanhu wa Tilo waizengela mhongono</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:3">na waiduganyila hela fana msanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:3">na zahabu fana viya timbwisi muna dikulugumbi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:4" />Mbali Mndewa kezawasegezela vinhu vawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:4">nayo kezautowa udahi wawo uweli nawo muna ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:4">nawo wezanangigwa kwa moto.<verse eid="ZEC 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:5" />Wanhu wa Ashikeloni wezaziwona mbuli zino na wezadumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:5">wanhu wa Gaza iviya wezakwingila luholozi ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:5">Wanhu wa Ekiloni wezadumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:5">kwaviya huwilo jawo dizakwaga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:5">Mfalume wa Gaza kezanangigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:5">bululu da Ashikeloni hadizakuwa na wanhu.<verse eid="ZEC 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:6" />Bululu da Ashidodi dizakaligwa na nyambenyambe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:6">na niye Mndewa Mulungu nizasegeza magoda ya Wafilisiti.<verse eid="ZEC 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:7" />Nizawatenda waleke kuja nyama mbisi na ndiya ya kutibusa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:7">Wanhu wondawasigale wezakuwa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:7">wezakuwa fana lukolo lumwe muna iisi ya Yuda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:7">Wanhu wa Ekiloni wezakuwa fana Wayebusi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:8" />Niye mwenyewo nizaikaliza isi yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:8">na nizagomesa mabumbila ya wehi sekeyafose umo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:8">Habule munhu yondayawagaze kaidi wanhu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:8">kwaviya nizawalola.<verse eid="ZEC 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalume wa Sayuni kezagala tindiwalo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:9" />Mutowe ng'henze ng'hani mweye wanhu wa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">Landuleni madizi, mweye wanhu wa Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">Loleni mfalume wenu kokwiza kumwenu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">Kohumiza voilondeka na kokombola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">Mnyendanyenda na kakwela mhunda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">Kakwela mwana mhunda.<verse eid="ZEC 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:10" />Kezasegeza matololi ya kubululigwa na falasi muna iisi ya Efulaimu na falasi wa ng'hondo kulawa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:10">mhinde za ng'hondo zizakwasigwa kutali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:10">Iyo kezagala tindiwalo muna izisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:10">Kezatawala kulawa bahali mbaka bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:10">kezatawala kulawa lwanda lwa Efulate mbaka uhelelo wa zisi zose.<verse eid="ZEC 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:11" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Kwa ichimu cha lagano jangu ditendigwe kwa damu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:11">nizawalopola wafungwa wenu wakalile wafungigwa muna dikombo dilibule mazi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:12" />Mweye wafungwa muli na uhuwilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:12">bweleni muna zimhongono za bululu jenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:12">niye nomgong'ondelani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:12">nizambwelezelani mbuli zinogile miyanza midi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:13" />Yuda nizamsang'hanila fana viya mhinde yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:13">Efulaimu nizamtenda msale wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:13">Weye Sayuni wanhu wako nizawasang'hanila fana viya zele da galu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:13">kwa kuwatowa wanhu wokala uko Uyunani.”<verse eid="ZEC 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:14" />Mndewa Mulungu kezawalawilila wanhu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:14">msale wake wizalawa fana lumwemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:14">Mndewa Mulungu kezatowa mhalati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:14">kezagenda muna divulavumbi da ubanzi wa kusi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:15" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kezawakaliza wanhu wake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:15">Iviya wezawananga wehi wawo wosang'hanila ng'humbwewe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:15">Wezaguta nyangi muna ing'hondo fana wanhu wakoligwe, wezaitila damu ya wehi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:15">fana damu ihakigwe hana yamahembe ya lupango kulawa muna dihamha.<verse eid="ZEC 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:16" />Lusita ulwo Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wawo kezawakombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:16">kwaviya wawo ni bumbila jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:16">ivo wezatelela muna iisi yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:16">fana mabwe ya hela nyingi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:17" />Lola unovu wawo viuli mwingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:17">lola viwatelele ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:17">Wandele na wabwanga wotelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:17">kwa ichimu cha ngano na divai ya sambi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ZEC 10" />
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu kezawakombola wanhu wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:1" />Mpuleni Mndewa Mulungu yagale mvula za sika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:1">Mndewa Mulungu iyo yogala mawingu ya mvula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:1">Iviya koweng'ha wanhu mvula za nyiminyimi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:1">na koweng'ha wanhu wose ndiya muna imigunda.<verse eid="ZEC 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:2" />Nyang'hiti za milungu yawo zolonga uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:2">walaguzi wawo wolagula uvwizi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:2">Walotezi wawo wolotela nzozi za uvwizi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:2">na wowaguma moyo wanhu, mbali haifaya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:2">Lekamana wanhu wowegela fana ng'hondolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:2">wogaya kwaviya wabule mdimi.<verse eid="ZEC 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:3" />Nizawawonela ludoko wadimi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:3">na nizawatagusa walangulizi wawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:3">Niye Mndewa Mulungu Nili na Udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:3">nizadilolesa bumbila jangu welesi wa Yuda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:3">Nizawatenda wawe falasi wangu wa ng'hondo.<verse eid="ZEC 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:4" />Kuna dikabila da Yuda kwizalawilila mhanda ya mgomba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:4">uko vizalawilila vigingi va hema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:4">uko kwizalawilila mhinde ya ng'hondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:4">Kumwake yeye kwizalawilila chila mtawala.<verse eid="ZEC 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:5" />Wanhu wa Yuda wezakuwa fana magalu kuna ing'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:5">wezawabojoga wehi wawo muna inhope mnzila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:5">Wezaitowa kwaviya niye Mndewa Mulungu nahamwe nawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:5">Wezawaguma chinyala wakwela falasi wa wehi wawo.<verse eid="ZEC 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:6" />Nizawagangamiza wanhu wa Yuda na nizawataza welesi wa Yosefu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:6">Nizawabweleza kumwawo kwaviya nowawonela ubazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:6">nawo wezakuwa fana viya siwalemile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:6">Niye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wawo nizawedika mbuli ziwopula.<verse eid="ZEC 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:7" />Wanhu wa Isilaili wezakuwa fana magalu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:7">na mizoyo yawo izadeng'helela kwa divai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:7">Wana wawo wezawona mbuli zino na kudeng'helela</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:7">iviya mizoyo yawo izamdeng'helela Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="ZEC 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:8" />Nizawatanga wanhu wangu na kuwaduganya hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:8">kwaviya nizawakombola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:8">Nawo wezakuwa wengi fana viwakalile umwaka.<verse eid="ZEC 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:9" />Ingawa niwapwililisa muna izisi zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:9">wezanikumbuka wahawa umo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:9">Wawo hamwe na wanawo wezabwela.<verse eid="ZEC 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:10" />Nizawabweleza kulawa isi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:10">nizawaduganya kulawa isi ya Ashulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:10">Nizawagala muna iisi ya Gileadi na Lebanoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:10">wawo wezamema chila hanhu.<verse eid="ZEC 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:11" />Wezafosa muna ibahali ya magayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:11">bahali itibuke izakala zinziwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:11">hanhu hagidimile ha lwanda lwa Naili hezanyala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:11">Magoda ya Ashulu yezahumulusigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:11">na nguvu za Misili zizahalawa.<verse eid="ZEC 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:12" />Nizawagangamiza kwa nguvu yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:12">Wezanitegeleza na kutenda mbuli zonilonda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:12">Niye Mndewa Mulungu nilonga ivo.<verse eid="ZEC 10:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ZEC 11" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:1" />Weye Lebanoni, fungula nyivi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:1">muladi moto uinange mibiki yako ya mielezi.<verse eid="ZEC 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:2" />Ugute nyangi weye mbiki wa msonobali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:2">kwaviya mibiki iyo inogile ya mielezi ilungula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:2">mibiki iyo inogile inangigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:2">Mweye miyaloni ya Bashani, mulile kwa giyogiyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:2">kwaviya mbago ng'hulu isengigwa.<verse eid="ZEC 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:3" />Tegeleza wadimi viwolila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:3">kwaviya ukulu wawo unangigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:3">Tegeleza mbumo wa wana simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:3">kwaviya mbago ya lwanda lwa Yoludani inangigwa.<verse eid="ZEC 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wadimi waidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:4" />Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wangu, kolonga, “Didime bumbila dodiilungigwa kuchinjigwa. <verse eid="ZEC 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:5" />Wagulaji wake wowachinja na wosegela bila kutagusigwa. Na waja wochuuza wolonga, ‘Mndewa Mulungu yatogolwe! Niye tajili.’ Wadimi wawo wenyewo hawawawonela ubazi.” <verse eid="ZEC 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:6" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Kwaviya sizawawonela ubazi kaidi wanhu wa isi ino, chila munhu nizamguma muna yamakono ya mkaya miyage na mfalume wake. Nawo wezaitenda vihile isi ino na niye sizamkombola munhu yoyose kulawa muna yamakono yawo.” <verse eid="ZEC 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:7" />Kwaviya nididima bumbila dilungiligwe kuchinjigwa na kuchuuzigwa. Maabaho nisola mabalati maidi, balati dimwe niditanga, “Unovu,” na dimwenga niditanga “Kuilumba.” Maabaho nihita kudima ng'hondolo. <verse eid="ZEC 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:8" />Kwa lusita lwa mwezi umwe niwakoma wadimi watatu. Bumbila da ng'hondolo dinihila, niye nilegezwa najo. <verse eid="ZEC 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:9" />Baho nilonga, “Sizakuwa mdimi wenu kaidi. Waleke waja wodanganika wadanganike na waja wonangigwa wanangigwe. Waja wasigale chila imwe yaje nyama ya miyage.” <verse eid="ZEC 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:10" />Nyamhisa balati jangu doniditangile, “Unovu,” nidibena kulagusa kuwa lagano Mndewa Mulungu diyekile na wanhu wake dibenigwa. <verse eid="ZEC 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:11" />Lagano ijo dibeneka siku iyo. Waja wogula ng'hondolo wakalile wonilola, wavimanya kuwa mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu inifikila. <verse eid="ZEC 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:12" />Niwalongela, “Muhawona vinoga, ning'heni yombe jangu, mbali muhawona havinogile, lekeni.” Ivo wanilingila vihande malongo matatu va hela kuwa yombe jangu. <verse eid="ZEC 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:13" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kanilongela, “Dike yombe ijo dodo ng'hani muna ingama ya kaye yangu.” Nisola vihande viya malongo matatu va hela, nimwasila munhu youmba nongo muna ikaye ya Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="ZEC 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:14" />Maabaho nidibena balati jangu dekaidi ditangigwe, “Kuilumba,” ivo niwagola Yuda na Isilaili.<verse eid="ZEC 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:15" />Mndewa Mulungu kanilongela, “Sola kaidi vinhu va mdimi mbozi. <verse eid="ZEC 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:16" />Kwaviya nizamgala mdimi yelibule ubazi kwa ng'hondolo yokwaga hebu halola goya wanang'hondolo hebu kuwahonya wolumwa hebu kuwadima wanenehe, mbali koja ng'hondolo wanenehe mbaka mapaga yawo.<verse eid="ZEC 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:17" />“Kezagaya mdimi hafaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:17">Yodileka bumbila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:17">zele dikanhe mkono wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:17">na ziso jake da kulume ding'oligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:17">mkono wake uholole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:17">ziso jake da kulume sekedilole.”<verse eid="ZEC 11:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ZEC 12" />
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa bululu da Yelusalemu wowahuma wehi wawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:1" />Usenga wa Mndewa Mulungu wosonhela isi ya Isilaili. Mndewa Mulungu yanzanze ulanga na yekile vandusilo va zisi zose na yaumbile mihe ya wanhu kolonga, <verse eid="ZEC 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:2" />“Nizaitenda Yelusalemu kuwa fana nhungo ya divai, zisi zili habehi yake zizakung'wa na kuzazalika fana viya wanhu wakoligwe. Bululu da Yelusalemu na mabululu yose ya Yuda yezatowigwa. <verse eid="ZEC 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:3" />Siku izo nizaitenda Yelusalemu kuwa fana dibwe dizamile kwa wanhu wose. Wanhu wondawadinule wezailumiza wenyewo. Wanhu wa zisi zose wezaditowa bululu ijo. <verse eid="ZEC 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:4" />Niye Mndewa Mulungu nolonga ivo. Muna isiku iyo nizamguma ludumbo chila falasi na mkwelafalasi wake nizamtenda kuwa mtachichala. Nizawatula yameso falasi wa zisi zimwenga, mbali kabila da Yuda nizadikaliza. <verse eid="ZEC 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:5" />Maabaho watawala wa Yuda wezalonga muna imizoyo yawo, ‘Wanhu wa Yelusalemu wana nguvu kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi niiyo Mulungu wawo.’<verse eid="ZEC 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:6" />“Muna isiku iyo nizawatenda watawala wa Yuda wawe fana moto ukwaka muna dibugulu da ngodi, fana viwenge vikwaka muna yamakinza ya ngano. Wezawananga wanhu wa banzi zose. Mbali bululu da Yelusalemu dizasigala na tindiwalo.<verse eid="ZEC 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:7" />“Niye Mndewa Mulungu nizawalopola welesi wa Yuda teng'hu, muladi hishima ya welesi wa Daudi na hishima ya wakaya wa Yelusalemu sekeiwe ng'hulu kufosa Yuda. <verse eid="ZEC 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:8" />Siku iyo niye Mndewa Mulungu nizawakaliza wakaya wa Yelusalemu, muladi weli nyondenyonde wawe na nguvu fana mfalume Daudi. Na welesi wa Daudi wezakuwa fana Mulungu. Wezakuwa fana msenga wa Mndewa Mulungu yowalongolela. <verse eid="ZEC 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:9" />Siku iyo nizananga zisi zose ziditowa bululu da Yelusalemu.”<verse eid="ZEC 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:10" />Maabaho nizawamemeza wanhu wa kaye ya Daudi na wakaya wa bululu da Yelusalemu muhe wa ubazi na kupula. Nawo wezamulola iyo yowamuhomile na iviya wezamulilila fana viya munhu viyomulilila mwanage nyachende. Iviya wezawona usungu kwa ichimu chake fana viya munhu viyowona usungu kwa ichimu cha mwanage wa udele. <verse eid="ZEC 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:11" />Siku iyo kwizakuwa na ndilo ng'hulu uko Yelusalemu. Fana ndilo ya uko Hadadi Limoni muna dibawe da Megido. <verse eid="ZEC 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:12" />Wanhu wa isi wezalila, chila lukolo wezalila waidumwe. Lukolo lwa kaye ya Daudi wezalila waidumwe na wake zawo wezalila waidumwe. Iviya lukolo lwa kaye ya Nasani wezalila waidumwe na wake zawo wezalila waidumwe. <verse eid="ZEC 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:13" />Lukolo lwa Lawi wezalila waidumwe na wake zawo waidumwe. Iviya lukolo lwa Shimei wezalila waidumwe na wake zawo waidumwe. <verse eid="ZEC 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:14" />Ng'holo zose zisigale wezalila waidumwe na wake zawo wezalila waidumwe.<verse eid="ZEC 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ZEC 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:1" />Siku iyo kwizalawilila nzasa ya kuwasafya uhasanyi na kuwasafya wanhu wambule mwiko wa welesi wa Daudi na wanhu wose wokala Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ZEC 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:2" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga, “Siku iyo nizasegeza mazina ya nyang'hiti za milungu muna iisi na hayezakumbukigwa kaidi. Iviya wanhu woigoda kuwa walotezi, nizawasegeza hamwe na muhe wa kutenda mbuli zihile. <verse eid="ZEC 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:3" />Munhu yoyose yahaigoda kuwa yeye mulotezi, tati yake na mami yake wamweleke wezamulongela, ‘Weye kolondeka kudanganika kwaviya kolonga uvwizi kwa zina da Mndewa Mulungu.’ Maabaho tati yake na mami yake wezamuhoma na mwele kuno kolotela. <verse eid="ZEC 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:4" />Siku iyo chila mulotezi kezakugwa chinyala kwa ichimu cha malaguso yake viyolotela. Hawezavala mawalo ya mazoya muladi wawavwizile wanhu. <verse eid="ZEC 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:5" />Chila imwe kezalonga, ‘Niye siyo mulotezi, mbali niye mulimaji. Nihazi migunda kwandusila vinikalile mbwanga.’ <verse eid="ZEC 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:6" />Mbali munhu yahamuuza imwe wawo, ‘Milulumu ino youli nayo muna ulukuli lwako ilawa kulihi?’ Yeye kezakwidika, ‘Milulumu ino niipata muna ikaye ya mbwiya zangu.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mdimi kotowigwa na ng'hondolo woimwaga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:7" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga, “Lamuka weye zele. Ima umtowe mdimi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">mdimi yonisang'hanila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">Umkome mdimi na ng'hondolo wezaimwaga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">Nizagolosa mkono wangu kuwatowa wanang'hondolo.<verse eid="ZEC 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:8" />Selusi mbili za wanhu zizadanganizigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:8">mbali selusi imwe izasigala.<verse eid="ZEC 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:9" />Selusi imwe yondaisigale, nizaigeza na kuisafya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">fana viya munhu viyosunha hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">fana viya viyolinga zahabu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">Maabaho wawo wezanipula niye na nizawedika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">Nizalonga, ‘Wawo wanhu wangu,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">wawo wezalonga, ‘Mndewa Mulungu niiyo Mulungu wetu.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 13:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ZEC 14" />
  <para style="s">Siku ya Mndewa Mulungu ya kutagusa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:1" />Siku ya Mndewa Mulungu ya kutagusa yokwiza, ivo vinhu vose visoligwe kumwenu vizagoligwa kuno molola. <verse eid="ZEC 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:2" />Mndewa Mulungu kezawaduganya wanhu wa zisi zimwenga kuditowa bululu da Yelusalemu. Bululu dizasoligwa na vinhu vili muna ikaye vizahokigwa. Iviya wezawabandama wanaake kwa kuwawangiliza. Nusu ya wanhu wa bululu wezalawa kuhita kuuhami. Mbali wanhu wondawasigale hawezasegezigwa muna dibululu. <verse eid="ZEC 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:3" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kezalawa na kuzitowa zisi fana viya viyotenda lusita lwa kuitowa ng'hondo. <verse eid="ZEC 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:4" />Siku iyo magulu yake yezakwima muna umulima wa mizaituni uli ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa wa Yelusalemu. Mulima uwo wizatuligwa banzi mbili na kolongo galamu dizalawilila ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa mbaka ubanzi wa uswilo wa zuwa. Ubanzi umwe wizakuwa kasikazi na ubanzi umwenga wizakuwa kusi. <verse eid="ZEC 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:5" />Mweye mwizakimbila kufosela kolongo ijo da kuludonho lwa milima midi ya Mndewa Mulungu dodifika Aseli. Mwizakimbila fana viya wasaho zenu viwakimbile gudemeko da isi lusita lwa utawala wa mfalume Uzia wa Yuda. Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wangu kezakwiza hamwe na welile wose.<verse eid="ZEC 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:6" />Siku iyo hakwizakuwa na bung'hulo hebu mbeho hebu nhungwe iganda. <verse eid="ZEC 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:7" />Imisi izagendelela na hakwizakuwa na ziza. Mbali Mndewa Mulungu kovimanya vondailawilile. Hakwizakuwa imisi hebu ichilo. Kwaviya mbaka zuwa dahahonga dogendelela kwaka.<verse eid="ZEC 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:8" />Siku iyo mazi yanogile yezalawa uko Yelusalemu. Ubanzi umwe wizahita kwiibahali ya ulawilo wa zuwa na ubanzi umwenga wizahita ubanzi wa bahali ya uswelo wa zuwa. Mazi yake yezagendelela kulawa lusita lwa zuwa kali na lusita lwa mvula.<verse eid="ZEC 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:9" />Siku iyo Mndewa Mulungu niiyo yondayawe mfalume muhala muna izisi zose. Kezakuwa Mndewa Mulungu yaidumwe na zina jake dizakuwa zina da chiidumwe. <verse eid="ZEC 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:10" />Isi yose kwandusila Geba uko kasikazi ya Yuda mbaka Limoni, kusi ya Yelusalemu izakuwa fana isi ya Alaba. Mbali Yelusalemu izasigala uchanyha hanhu hake kwandusila lwivi lukulu lwa Benyamini mbaka hanhu ha lwivi lukulu lwa umwaka mbaka kuna ulwivi lukulu lwa mumgwazo na kulawa kuna dilingo da Hananeli mbaka hana ihanhu ha mfalume ha kuhondela zabibu. <verse eid="ZEC 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:11" />Bululu da Yelusalemu dizakaligwa na wanhu, kwaviya umo hamwizakuwa na duwilo kaidi da kunanga na wanhu wake wezakala vinogile.<verse eid="ZEC 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:12" />Mbali kwa wanhu waja wezile kwiitowa na Yelusalemu uno niuwo utamu wondaugaligwe na Mndewa Mulungu, ng'huli zawo zizawola wang'hali wagima. Meso yawo yezawola yang'hali kuna yamazonzo yake. Milimi yawo izawola ing'hali muna imilomo yawo. <verse eid="ZEC 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:13" />Siku iyo Mndewa Mulungu kezawatenda wanhu wadumbe ng'hani. Chila munhu kezamtowa miyage. <verse eid="ZEC 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:14" />Wanhu wa Yuda wezaitowa ng'hondo na Yelusalemu. Utajili wa zisi zimwenga zili banzi zose za Yuda wizaiduganya. Wezaduganya zahabu nyingi na hela na mawalo. <verse eid="ZEC 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:15" />Utamu fana uwo wizawapata falasi na wanyama walingile fana vihongwe na ngamiya na mhunda na wanyama wose wondawawe muna yamalago ya wehi.<verse eid="ZEC 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:16" />Maabaho chila munhu yahonyokwe muna izisi zose zizile kwiitowa na Yelusalemu, kezakwiza mwaka kwa mwaka muladi kumtambikila mfalume, Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi na kuitendela chelekocheleko dugila da vibanda. <verse eid="ZEC 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:17" />One wanhu wowose muna iisi yose hawahita Yelusalemu kumtambikila mfalume, Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi, mvula haizatonya muna iisi yawo. <verse eid="ZEC 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:18" />One wanhu wa Misili hawezahita, iviya mvula haizatonya kumwawo. Mndewa Mulungu kezawatowa kwa utamu wa tauni, utamu uwo wizazitowa zisi zose waja hawahita muladi kutenda chelekocheleko kwa dugila da vibanda. <verse eid="ZEC 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:19" />Ino izakuwa nhaguso ya Misili na nhaguso ya zisi zose ziya hazihita kuditendela chelekocheleko dugila da vibanda.<verse eid="ZEC 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:20" />Siku iyo kuna zimbugi za falasi kwizakwandikigwa mbuli zino, “Vikigwa hakwe kwa Mndewa Mulungu.” Nongo zili muna ikaye ya Mndewa Mulungu zizakuwa fana mahamha yoyokuwa kuulongozi wa lupango. <verse eid="ZEC 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:21" />Chila nongo umo Yelusalemu na isi ya Yuda izakwikigwa hakwe kwa Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi, muladi wose wolava nhambiko wadahe kuzisang'hanila kwa kwambikila nyama ya nhambiko. Siku iyo hakwizakuwa na mchuuzi yoyose muna ikaye ya Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi.<verse eid="ZEC 14:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 14" />
</usx>